GRAYLINE PDN — NODE GL-01 — LOCAL BULLETIN
Crossbar terminal software  ·  edited on the pad
────────────────────────────────────────────────

02 Oct 2026  CONNECT MUDPROTO
  New circuit: MudProto on 9600. Character
  login is owned by that door — not your
  Grayline handle. Hang up with ~. or QUIT.

01 Oct 2026  Crossbar — GROUPS forums
  GROUPS is local Usenet-style discussion
  (grayline.general / .doors / .sysop).
  NEWS remains this system bulletin. Packet
  mesh between Crossbar sites comes later.

01 Oct 2026  Crossbar 0.3.2 — MAIL and WALL
  Registered handles get pad-local letters:
  MAIL LIST/READ/SEND/REPLY/FWD/DEL/ARCHIVE.
  Unread notice after CIRCUIT OPEN. Operators
  broadcast as sysop from the console. WALL
  is file-backed in wall.asc (last ten lines);
  WALL <text> appends. Trim it over SSH.

01 Oct 2026  Crossbar build on GL-01
  Public logon paint, menu chrome, and the pad
  prompt are now file-backed under the text spool.
  Operators may revise welcome / menu / prompt
  without a cutover. CLEAR / CLR wipe the glass.

01 Oct 2026  Finger restored
  FINGER with no args lists stations on the wire.
  FINGER <handle> is long form: on-since, idle,
  mail, and plan. Wallet addresses stay off the
  wire. SYSOP and ADMIN still refuse mail.

30 Sep 2026  PSCHAIN peer tags
  Node and miner lines print a short hash of the
  peer id. Raw ip:port is not shown on the pad.

29 Sep 2026  Circuit board
  BEC orientation circuit: UP at 1200.
  TYMNET carrier hop: UP at T1.
  Terminal Addiction: OFFLINE — no carrier.

28 Sep 2026  Consortium note
  Grayline remains a public data network in no
  particular year. Door eras stay behind CONNECT.
  Claims and profile_config remain on the pad for
  registered handles. Guest is accepted without a
  row.

— end of bulletin —
